  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilience with Active Countercyclical Expenditures Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The principal objective of the Program is to mitigate the adverse socio-economic effects of the economic crises and enhance the resilience of poor and vulnerable groups to socio-economic shocks. The scope of the proposed program includes implementation of (a) increased social protection measures; (b) increased food security measures; and (c) enhanced support for business.</narrative>
  </description>
